 },
 "summary": "Flat chip platinum resistance thermometers made as a thin platinum film on an alumina ceramic chip, with tin-over-nickel end terminations. The resistance against temperature follows the IEC 60751 curve (+3850 ppm/K), with 100 Ω, 500 Ω or 1000 Ω at 0 °C and tolerance class F0.3 or F0.6, over -55 °C to +155 °C. PTS080501B500RP100 is the 0805, 500 Ω, class F0.3 sensor on a 1000-piece reel.",
