  {
   "topic": "Construction",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "A uniform platinum film on a high-grade Al2O3 ceramic chip is conditioned for the correct temperature coefficient and stability, then covered by a protective coating. The ends are plated pure matte tin over nickel; tin whisker resistance has been tested."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Testing and packing",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "Every sensor is tested; only passing parts go into paper tape to IEC 60286-3."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Storage",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "Solderability holds for 2 years from production or requalification; 2 years is the allowed storage time."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Assembly",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "Placed by automatic SMD machines and soldered by wave, reflow or vapour phase; lead-free soldering is supported. The coating withstands the usual electronics cleaning solvents, alcohols, esters and water-based solutions included. Any conformal coating has to be shown not to upset how stable the assembly stays over time. Potting resin must not touch the coating or the terminations. Where the sensor runs hot often, choose board material and solder that match it thermally."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Response and self-heating",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "Self-heating and response times apply to the bare element. The shortest response time is t0.9 ≤ 2 s in air (0603, air at 3.0 m/s)."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Ordering",
   "page": 3,
   "text": "A part is ordered by the 18-character part number or by the shorter product description, which is the recommended form. Part number fields: PTS, size code (0603, 0805, 1206), special character 0, tolerance class (1B = F0.3, 2B = F0.6), resistance (100R, 500R, 1K00), packing (PU, P1), special 00 (standard). Product description fields: PTS, size, tolerance (-B = F0.3, 2B = F0.6), packing, resistance (100R, 500R, 1K)."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Compliance and approvals",
   "page": 2,
   "text": "Meets the CEFIC-EECA-EICTA substance restrictions, ELV 2000/53/EC with its Annex II, RoHS 2011/65/EU and WEEE 2002/96/EC; halogen free. Tested to IEC 60751 and the IEC 60068 series."
  }
